      "content": "i hear you, but i really hate the idea of waiting around when i feel this way. if i can't get a doctor on the phone right now, i just need to know if there's a safe amount i can at least do myself. like, if i just take like 5mg of a vitamin k supplement or eat a lot of kale today, is that really going to be \"unpredictable\" or is it just a way for doctors to avoid giving simple advice? i just want to know what a reasonable dose would be to try and level it out myself.",
